: private method PHP error<br \\/>\\nVersion 2.0.23 (Nov 08, 2022)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Category addon count issue<br \\/>\\nVersion 2.0.22 (Oct 05, 2022)<br \\/>\\nAdded: User status online\\/offline<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.21 (Sep 14, 2022)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Session error log<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.20 (Aug 12, 2022)<br \\/>\\nUpdated: Security &amp; Sanitisation<br \\/>\\nUpdated: Change text naming<br \\/>\\nUpdated: Checkout Rest API<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.19 (July 25, 2022)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Unread message email quote sign issue<br \\/>\\nFixed: Elementor addon parent category issue<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.18 (June 29, 2022)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Chat table regeneration issue<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.17 (June 07, 2022)<br \\/>\\n<strong>Added<\\/strong>: App Woo payment support<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.16 (May 18, 2022)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Stripe text translation issue<br \\/>\\nFixed: Custom Field select\\/checkbox filter issue<br \\/>\\nUpdated: Layout style<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.15 (May 10, 2022)<br \\/>\\nUpdated: Guzzle PHP client https:\\/\\/docs.guzzlephp.org<br \\/>\\nFixed: translation issue for stripe payment getaway<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.12 (April 11, 2022)<br \\/>\\nAdded: Elementor Archive &amp; Single Page Builder Addon compatibility<br \\/>\\nAdded: Per sign control in the Pricing Box addon<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.10 (March 01, 2022)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Backend widget area console error<br \\/>\\nAdded: Pricing Table Gutenberg block<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.9 (Feb 16, 2022)<br \\/>\\nAdded: Gutenberg Blacks (Listings, Listings category, All locations, Singe location,<br \\/>\\ncategory slider, listing slider)<br \\/>\\nVersion 2.0.8 (Jan 20, 2022)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Compatible with free version 2.1.0<br \\/>\\nAdded: Elementor Widget<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.7 (Jan 04, 2022)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Push notification translation.<br \\/>\\nFixed: Radius search filter widget translation.<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.5.2 (Dec 15, 2021)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Stripe IOS payment issue<br \\/>\\nAdded: comment form script<br \\/>\\nAdd: Rating filter<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.5.2 (Dec 15, 2021)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Free &amp; Pro version dependency <\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.5.1 (Dec 13, 2021)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Fix option error.<br \\/>\\nFixed: Remove unwanted localization for map.<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.5 (Dec 09, 2021)<br \\/>\\nAdd: Re-captcha V 3<br \\/>\\nAdd: OpenStreetMap<br \\/>\\nUpdate: API update for Map<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.3 (Nov 15, 2021)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Add google social login using google firebase<br \\/>\\nVersion 2.0.2.6 (Nov 04, 2021)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Push notification table column rename issue<br \\/>\\nVersion 2.0.2.5 (Oct 27, 2021)<br \\/>\\nAdd push notifications for app<br \\/>\\nVersion 2.0.2.4 (Sep 28, 2021)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Review template<br \\/>\\nAdd: Stripe 3D SAP secure payment Option<br \\/>\\nUpdate: coding structure<br \\/>\\nAdd: orders and orders\\/xxxxxx rest API<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.2.3 (Sep 14, 2021)<br \\/>\\nFix: conditional field issue for multilingual<br \\/>\\nFix: multilingual custom field delete issue<br \\/>\\nUpdate: payment rtcl-api end point<br \\/>\\nUpdate: Rest api end point<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.2.2 (Aug 13, 2021)<br \\/>\\nAdd: Seller Contact information for register user.<br \\/>\\nFix: Map marker issue<br \\/>\\nUpdate: Rest API <\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.2.1 (July 28, 2021)<br \\/>\\nBugfix: Custom fields filtering.<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.2 (July 16, 2021)<br \\/>\\nUpdate: Rest API<br \\/>\\nBugfix: Some bug fix.<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.1 (Jun 28, 2021)<br \\/>\\nFix: REST API issue fixed<br \\/>\\nFix: Classified listing free version dependency Update<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 2.0.0 (Jun 24, 2021)<br \\/>\\nFix: Map control.<br \\/>\\nFix: Password Reset link.<br \\/>\\nUpdate: Update code to work on free version. Now need to install free version first.<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.5.73.9 (May 07, 2021)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Membership issue<br \\/>\\nFixed: Ordering issue<br \\/>\\nFixed: Compare issue<br \\/>\\nFixed: Pending post expired text issue<br \\/>\\nFixed: Apply filter button hide issue<br \\/>\\nFixed: Listing image resize error issue<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.5.73.7 (April 15, 2021)<br \\/>\\nFixed: App data connect issue<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.5.73.5 (Feb 14, 2021)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Membership issue<br \\/>\\nFixed: Unregistered user posting ad issue<br \\/>\\nAdded: Pricing range and disable feature<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.5.73.2 (Feb 11, 2021)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Forgot password issue<br \\/>\\nFixed: Listing post edit alert issue<br \\/>\\nFixed: Compare responsive issue<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.5.73 (Jan 29, 2021)<br \\/>\\nAdd: Mark as Sold<br \\/>\\nAdd: Google Location<br \\/>\\nAdd: Radius Search<br \\/>\\nAdd: Conditional Fields<br \\/>\\nAdd: Business Hours (Directory)<br \\/>\\nAdd: Social Profiles (Directory)<br \\/>\\nAdd: Quick View<br \\/>\\nAdd: Compare ads<br \\/>\\nAdd: Youtube &amp; Vimeo Video<br \\/>\\nAdd: Add new grid &amp; list layout<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.5.72 (Nov 28, 2020)<br \\/>\\nAdd: Youtube. Vimeo video in listing<br \\/>\\nFix: Login data security<br \\/>\\nFix: Image Sorting<br \\/>\\nAdd: Conditional custom fields<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.5.70 (Oct 02, 2020)<br \\/>\\nFix: Backend Bump up issue<br \\/>\\nFix: Front end Embedded Video<br \\/>\\nFix: Custom number field<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.5.69 (Sep 17, 2020)<br \\/>\\nFix: Paypal Payment Issue<br \\/>\\nVersion 1.5.65 (Aug 11, 2020)<br \\/>\\nAdd: Promotion package included within the membership package (Store addon)<br \\/>\\nFix: Fix some bug<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.5.62 (June 12, 2020)<br \\/>\\nFix: Sub-category selection issue for membership<br \\/>\\nFix: Bump up Daily<br \\/>\\nFix: Some email issue<br \\/>\\nUpdate: Some template hook<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.5.57 (April 30, 2020)<br \\/>\\nAdd: First name, Last name &amp; mobile no in the registration form<br \\/>\\nFix: Top &amp; Featured ads expire time<br \\/>\\nFix: Left widget filtering option<br \\/>\\nFix: Free &amp; membership ad counting<br \\/>\\nImprove: Location &amp; category data loading issue<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.5.3 (Mar 12, 2020)<br \\/>\\nAdd: Yoast SEO compatibility<br \\/>\\nVersion 1.5.2 ( Feb 18,\\u00a0 2020)<br \\/>\\nFix: Some bug fixing<br \\/>\\nAdd: Live Chat (Buyer &amp; Seller)<br \\/>\\nFix: Some Responsive Issue<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.4.13 (Jan 14,\\u00a0 2019)<br \\/>\\nAdd: WooCommerce Payment Gateway<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.4.10 (Dec 11,\\u00a0 2019)<br \\/>\\nAdd: WhatsApp no<br \\/>\\nAdd: Store Rating<br \\/>\\nAdd: Unlimited category<br \\/>\\nAdd: Top search widget different style (auto search, dependency selection, standard)<br \\/>\\nAdd: Settings for email ad own contact form 7<br \\/>\\nAdd: Date Field with range<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.3.0 (Oct 09,\\u00a0 2019)<br \\/>\\nAdd: New email system with template.<br \\/>\\nAdd: Price unit per category.<br \\/>\\nAdd: Privacy policy and Term and condition settings<br \\/>\\nUpdate: Update some hook and coding style<br \\/>\\nUpdate: Update some UX <\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.2.24 (Aug 06,\\u00a0 2019)<br \\/>\\nFixed: Fixed some bug<br \\/>\\nAdd: Added control for image zoom &amp; popup.<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.2.23 (July 31,\\u00a0 2019)<br \\/>\\nFixed some bug<br \\/>\\nAdd: Search by types<br \\/>\\nAdd: Category listing by types [Shortcode]<br \\/>\\nAdd: Email notification for email edit or modification.<br \\/>\\nFix: Source map issue.<br \\/>\\nAdd: Redirect option after Edit and posed new listing<br \\/>\\nAdd: New Price type added (Price on call)<br \\/>\\nAdd: Category import<br \\/>\\nAdd: Social Login (we support any third-party plugin)<br \\/>\\nFix: Membership user can post at a free category, Have the option to turn off or on<br \\/>\\nFix: Membership new order and confirm mail notification<br \\/>\\nFix: Membership expired days NaN issue is fixed at Safari browser<br \\/>\\nAdd: Send notification to admin, when user edit store information<br \\/>\\nAdd: Title and short description limit <\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.2.21<br \\/>\\nFix: WooCommerce conflict<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.2.20<br \\/>\\nAdd: admin email notification for new user registration.<br \\/>\\nAdd: Dynamic Add type<br \\/>\\nAdd: Settings for store only for members<br \\/>\\nFix: Listing page as home page issue fixed.<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.2.17<br \\/>\\nFix: Payment History<br \\/>\\nAdd: WhatsApp share<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.2<br \\/>\\nFix: Email Verification<br \\/>\\nMore control<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.1.3 (Nov 22, 2018)<br \\/>\\nAdd: Added Option for non-login user post ads<br \\/>\\nFix: Fixed some bug<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.1.0 (Oct 09, 2018)<br \\/>\\nAdd: Map View<br \\/>\\nFix: Some Related Bugfix<\\/p>\\n<p>Version 1.1.0 (Oct 09, 2018)<br \\/>\\nAdd: Review &amp; Rating option<br \\/>\\nAdd: Bump up add option<br \\/>\\nAdd: More Fields contrpre<br \\/>\\nAdd: Pricing tab<br \\/>\\nSome Related Bugfix<\\/p>\\n\"},\"license_check\":\"\",\"msg\":\"No license key has been provided.\",\"homepage\":\"https:\\/\\/www.radiustheme.com\\/downloads\\/classified-listing-pro-wordpress\\/\",\"package\":\"\",\"icons\":\"a:2:{s:2:\\\"1x\\\";s:124:\\\"https:\\/\\/www.radiustheme.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/edd\\/2025\\/11\\/classified-listing-classified-ads-business-directory-128x128.webp\\\";s:2:\\\"2x\\\";s:124:\\\"https:\\/\\/www.radiustheme.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/edd\\/2025\\/11\\/classified-listing-classified-ads-business-directory-256x256.webp\\\";}\",\"banners\":{\"high\":\"\",\"low\":\"\"},\"slug\":\"classified-listing-pro\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.radiustheme.com\\/downloads\\/classified-listing-pro-wordpress\\/?changelog=1\",\"last_updated\":\"2026-07-28 11:15:09\",\"download_link\":\"\",\"upgrade_notice\":\"\",\"description\":[\"<p>The Best Classified Listing and Business Directory Plugin for WordPress to create Classified ads website, job directory, directory and service directory.<\\/p>\\n\"],\"changelog\":[\"<p>Version 4.2.0 (July 28, 2026)<\\/p>\\n<p>Added: Header & contact single layout fields.<br \\/>\\nAdded: Subscriptio