dded: Free ads count in dashboard statistics</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.25 (Jan 11, 2023)<br />\nFixed: Free and membership post count issue<br />\nAdded: New new new option for all users / Only membership</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.24 (Dec 06, 2022)<br />\nAdded: Listing renew from membership<br />\nVersion 1.4.23 (Nov 25, 2022)<br />\nFixed: Javascript issue with checkout<br />\nAdded: Added some hooks for the free version</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.21 (Sep 14, 2022)<br />\nAdded: Store review compatibility with Review Schema<br />\nFixed: Session error log</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.20 (Aug 12, 2022)<br />\nUpdated: Security &amp; Sanitisation<br />\nUpdate: Change text naming</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.19 (July 25, 2022)<br />\nFixed: Day start issue<br />\nAdded: Coupon addon compatibility</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.18 (July 06, 2022)<br />\nFixed: Week starts on from settings<br />\nFixed: Membership regular ad field issue</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.17 (Jul 01, 2022)<br />\nAdded: New Feature for Store Single Page builder.<br />\nVersion 1.4.14 (May 10, 2022)<br />\nFixed: PHP Warning issue</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.12 (April 12, 2022)<br />\nAdded: Store Grid/List Elementor Addon</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.10 (March 01, 2022)<br />\nFixed: Front-end dashboard store error<br />\nVersion 1.4.9 (Feb 16, 2022)<br />\nAdded: Store Category<br />\nVersion 1.4.8.2 (Dec 15, 2021)<br />\nFix : Auto redirect Membership checkout page<br />\nFix: Store contact form issue</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.8.1 (Dec 13, 2021)<br />\n Fixed: reCaptha issue for store contact form</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.8 (Dec 09, 2021)<br />\nAdd: Google Re-captcha V3 Support</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.7 (Nov 15, 2021)<br />\nFixed: Installing function not found issue</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.6.3 (Sep 28, 2021)<br />\nFixed: Review template loading issue<br />\nFixed: some coding issues<br />\nAdded: Addon filter to remove addon if installed</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.6.1 (Aug 13, 2021)<br />\nUpdate: Rest API<br />\nAdd: Control for Store contact info hide guest user. </p>\n<p>Version 1.4.5 (July 28, 2021)<br />\nFixed: Mobile app Rest Api call issue<br />\nImpromove: Classified listing free version dependency Update</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.4 (Jun 24, 2021)<br />\nFix: Radius Search<br />\nImprove: code to work Classified Pro version 2.0<br />\nVersion 1.4.2 (April 15, 2021)<br />\nAdd: Store api connect for app<br />\nVersion 1.4.0 (Mar 14, 2021)<br />\nAdd: Store Manager feature<br />\nVersion 1.3.28(Aug 11, 2020)<br />\nAdd: Promotion under Membership package<br />\nversion 1.3.22 (April 30, 2020)<br />\nAdd: Archive page<br />\nAdd: Store Category</p>\n<p>version 1.3.10 (Dec 11, 2019)<br />\nAdd: Social Icon<br />\nAdd: Store Rating<br />\nAdd: 24h Store hrs format</p>\n<p>version 1.1.80 (May 23, 2019)<br />\nAdd nofollow link in store url<br />\nVersion 1.1.6 (Apr 25, 2019)<br />\nAdd settings store only for membership</p>\n\";}s:13:\"license_check\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"msg\";s:33:\"No license key has been provided.\";s:8:\"homepage\";s:94:\"https://www.radiustheme.com/downloads/classified-listing-store-membership-addon-for-wordpress/\";s:7:\"package\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"icons\";s:228:\"a:2:{s:2:\"1x\";s:94:\"https://www.radiustheme.com/wp-content/uploads/edd/2025/11/store-membership-addon-128x128.webp\";s:2:\"2x\";s:94:\"https://www.radiustheme.com/wp-content/uploads/edd/2025/11/store-membership-addon-256x256.webp\";}\";s:7:\"banners\";O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:4:\"high\";s:0:\"\";s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";}s:4:\"slug\";s:24:\"classified-listing-store\";s:3:\"url\";s:106:\"https://www.radiustheme.com/downloads/classified-listing-store-membership-addon-for-wordpress/?changelog=1\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2026-07-28 11:26:03\";s:13:\"download_link\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"upgrade_notice\";s:42:\"<p>Please update latest version 3.2.0</p>\n\";s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;s:14386:\"<p>Classified Listing Store &amp; Membership addon				</p>\n<p>Create your store within in the Classified ads website so visitor can get all items easily under the store.</p>\n<p>					<a href=\"#pricing\"><br />\n									Pricing Plan<br />\n					</a><br />\n					<a href=\"https://www.radiustheme.com/docs/classified-listing/docs/listing-management-admin/stores-store-addon/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br />\n									Documentation<br />\n					</a></p>\n<p>Classified Listing is a fully responsive WordPress plugin by using this plugin you can create a classified listing website easily.</p>\n<p>Classified Listing plugin will work with any standard coding WordPress Theme.</p>\n<p>Classified plugins included all necessary features that need to build a classified listing website. It has wide range of back end settings for site admin and front end ad posting management system like user can add/ edit / delete his post any time.</p>\n<p>					Store &amp; Membership Features				</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n										Fully Responsive &amp; Mobile Friendly\n									</li>\n<li>\n										Membership &amp; Store facility\n									</li>\n<li>\n										Open Own store with store details &amp; Opening hours\n									</li>\n<li>\n										Allow Subscription Payment (Authorize.net and Stripe)\n									</li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li>\n										Get all ads under store.\n									</li>\n<li>\n										Can set Membership by Category wise or full site access.\n									</li>\n<li>\n										Can set no of free ad for a time interval.\n									</li>\n</ul>\n<p>					Membership Creation​				</p>\n<p>You can create membership package so user can chose which package they want, you can create membership by specific category wise or give access for all categories also can give free ads facility by category wise.</p>\n<p>					Membership Package​				</p>\n<p>You can create a membership package so users can choose which package they want, you can create membership by a specific category wise or give access for all categories also can give free ads facility by category wise.</p>\n<p>					Allow Subscription Payment				</p>\n<p>Membership payment will renew when you enable subscription. Right now Stripe and Authorize payment support subscription payment.</p>\n<p>					Create Your Own store				</p>\n<p>This is first time in WordPress classified plugin have store facility. We have store addon after enable this addon you will get membership option with store facility. User can add there store detail like own store banner with description, opening hrs etc..</p>\n<p>When any user visit the store page they get the all listings of the store.</p>\n<p>					Get Classified Store &amp; Membership  Addom				</p>\n<ul role=\"tablist\">\n<li><a>Yearly</a></li>\n<li>Big Save<a>All Adodns Bundle</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>ThemeForest licenses don’t include support due to Envato’s ~60% commission on each sale. As non-exclusive Envato authors, <br />we provide support only for licenses purchased directly.</p>\n<p>                            Prefer priority support? More license options & bundles are available on our website.\n                        </p>\n<p>                        <a id=\"rt_envato_options_btn\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.radiustheme.com/downloads/classified-listing-store-membership-addon-for-wordpress/#pricing\">Explore More Options &rarr;</a></p>\n<p>                        Coming from ThemeForest? &#x1f44b;</p>\n<p>Since July 1, 2026, <strong>Envato retains about 60% of every ThemeForest sale</strong>- making it difficult to provide premium support and ongoing updates.</p>\n<p>Excluded from the envato license:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>× Priority Customer Support</li>\n<li>× Full access to extensions</li>\n</ul>\n<p>                        <a href=\"https://www.radiustheme.com/downloads/classified-listing-store-membership-addon-for-wordpress/#pricing\">Explore More Options &rarr;</a><br />\n										1 Site License<br />\n                                                                                                                                            $29 / Yearly<br />\n			                            Renews at $23/year, forever<br />\n              