3, 2021)<br />\n Fixed: reCaptha issue for store contact form</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.8 (Dec 09, 2021)<br />\nAdd: Google Re-captcha V3 Support</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.7 (Nov 15, 2021)<br />\nFixed: Installing function not found issue</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.6.3 (Sep 28, 2021)<br />\nFixed: Review template loading issue<br />\nFixed: some coding issues<br />\nAdded: Addon filter to remove addon if installed</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.6.1 (Aug 13, 2021)<br />\nUpdate: Rest API<br />\nAdd: Control for Store contact info hide guest user. </p>\n<p>Version 1.4.5 (July 28, 2021)<br />\nFixed: Mobile app Rest Api call issue<br />\nImpromove: Classified listing free version dependency Update</p>\n<p>Version 1.4.4 (Jun 24, 2021)<br />\nFix: Radius Search<br />\nImprove: code to work Classified Pro version 2.0<br />\nVersion 1.4.2 (April 15, 2021)<br />\nAdd: Store api connect for app<br />\nVersion 1.4.0 (Mar 14, 2021)<br />\nAdd: Store Manager feature<br />\nVersion 1.3.28(Aug 11, 2020)<br />\nAdd: Promotion under Membership package<br />\nversion 1.3.22 (April 30, 2020)<br />\nAdd: Archive page<br />\nAdd: Store Category</p>\n<p>version 1.3.10 (Dec 11, 2019)<br />\nAdd: Social Icon<br />\nAdd: Store Rating<br />\nAdd: 24h Store hrs format</p>\n<p>version 1.1.80 (May 23, 2019)<br />\nAdd nofollow link in store url<br />\nVersion 1.1.6 (Apr 25, 2019)<br />\nAdd settings store only for membership</p>\n\";}}s:49:\"classified-listing-pro/classified-listing-pro.php\";O:8:\"stdClass\":17:{s:4:\"name\";s:67:\"Classified Listing - Classified ads &amp; Business Directory Plugin\";s:11:\"new_version\";s:5:\"4.2.0\";s:14:\"stable_version\";s:5:\"4.2.0\";s:8:\"sections\";O:8:\"stdClass\":2:{s:11:\"description\";s:161:\"<p>The Best Classified Listing and Business Directory Plugin for WordPress to create Classified ads website, job directory, directory and service directory.</p>\n\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:18604:\"<p>Version 4.2.0 (July 28, 2026)</p>\n<p>Added: Header & contact single layout fields.<br />\nAdded: Subscription email notifications.<br />\nImproved: Form Builder usability and stability.<br />\nImproved: My Account dashboard redesign.<br />\nImproved: My Listings table and top filters.<br />\nImproved: Membership report layout design.<br />\nImproved: Chat functionality and styling.<br />\nFixed: Chat field error when Pro disabled.<br />\nFixed: WooPayment gateway checkout issues.<br />\nFixed: Buyer account access and payments.</p>\n<p>Version 4.1.0 (June 24, 2026)<br />\nFixed: Custom fields active filter option value issue<br />\nAdded: Mark-as-sold option in admin-end</p>\n<p>Version 4.0.8 (April 20, 2026)<br />\nFixed: Active filter option value display issue<br />\nFixed: Ajax filter issue for custom filed at taxonomy archive page</p>\n<p>Version 4.0.7 (Feb 18, 2026)<br />\nFixed: Subscription renew issue<br />\nFixed: Chat table regenerate issue<br />\nAdded: Custom text field search action button</p>\n<p>Version 4.0.6 (Dec 22, 2025)<br />\nFixed: Accessibility issues<br />\nVersion 4.0.5 (Nov 20, 2025)<br />\nFixed: Add/Remove favourite UX issue<br />\nFixed: Taxonomy-ordering issue<br />\nFixed: Single listing builder conditional field visibility issue fixed<br />\nAdded: AI Semantic Search &amp; AI Image Enhancement<br />\nUpdated: Add compare page while install for the first time<br />\nFixed: PhotoSwiper popup open issue<br />\nFixed: Form builder search and filter REST API</p>\n<p>Version 4.0.4 (Oct 15, 2025)<br />\nFixed: remove empty custom field from filters<br />\nFixed: Chat manage layout, delete option issue<br />\nUpdate: Settings integration with new layout<br />\nAdded: quick view and compare icon filter<br />\nUpdate: Compare content display issue for from builder custom field</p>\n<p>Version 4.0.3 (Aug 15, 2025)<br />\nAdded: Smart dependency logic at checkbox, radio, select field<br />\nFixed: Compare content display issue<br />\nFixed: get_avatar expect email or id but passed full comment object</p>\n<p>Version 4.0.2 (July 24, 2025)<br />\nFixed: Shortcode map view pagination issue<br />\nFixed: Form builder category, location field issue<br />\nFixed: Gallery show / hide issue<br />\nFixed: Video show / hide issue<br />\nFixed: Category widget column issue<br />\nAdded: Two action hooks for active map data ( rtcl_ajax_filter_query_before_loop, rtcl_ajax_filter_query_after_loop)</p>\n<p>Version 4.0.1 (July 16, 2025)<br />\nAdded: Image support at app push notification<br />\nAdded: Ajax filter: custom field filterable field apply conditional logic</p>\n<p>Version 4.0.0 (July 01, 2025)<br />\nUpdated: Reorganized admin settings<br />\nFixed: Popular badge show/hide issue</p>\n<p>Version 3.2.1 (June 13, 2025)<br />\nFixed: From builder – Conditional logic for check box field add includes and Not Includes operator<br />\nUpdated: Add login messages to start new chat<br />\nFixed: Mark as sold listing hidden issue when active filter/search<br />\nFixed: Chat message unread count issue<br />\nFixed: Chat body overflow scroll issue at chat for mobile</p>\n<p>Version 3.2.0 (May 27, 2025)<br />\nUpdated: Directory ajax filter field<br />\nAdded: Toolkit addon compatibility</p>\n<p>Version 3.1.2 (May 13, 2025)<br />\nFixed: Chat rtcl_conversation_messages table creating issue at new installation<br />\nVersion 3.1.1 (May 09, 2025)<br />\nFixed: Chat rest api: check conversation has started<br />\nFixed: My account chat list loading issue</p>\n<p>Version 3.1.0 (May 07, 2025)<br />\nUpdated: Page layout<br />\nAdded: Chat media/attachment upload<br />\nAdded: Chat admin back end for observe conversation<br />\nFixed: Elementor editor load issue<br />\nUpdated: Listing Slider Elementor addon<br />\nUpdated: Chat performance</p>\n<p>Version 3.0.5 (April 07, 2025)<br />\nAdded: Pusher configuration at config REST API<br />\nFixed: Sortable Search form issue</p>\n<p>Version 3.0.4 (Feb 21, 2025)<br />\nAdded: AI Power Form Generator and Write with AI.<br />\nFixed : Ajax filter Custom field: same field OR , different field AND relation<br />\nFixed: Custom field load issue at ajax filter<br />\nFixed: Duplicate top items at listings issue<br />\nUpdated: Chat performance updated<br />\nAdded: Pusher Added for update chat performance<br />\nAdded: remove beacon script<br />\nAdded: Pusher js for live chat<br />\nAdded: rtcl_user_online_status_seconds from js</p>\n<p>Version 3.0.3 (Feb 17, 2025)<br />\nAdded: Filter Hook Added (rtcl_is_chat_link_available)<br />\nFixed: Ajax Filter Date and Date Range filter issue</p>\n<p>Version 3.0.2 (Jan 31, 2025)<br />\nFixed: License key issue<br />\nFixed: Update REST API for APP</p>\n<p>Version 3.0.1 (Jan 13, 2025)<br />\nUpdated: Rest API (Add Form builder support for App)<br />\nFixed: Rest API kei generation issue<br />\nFixed: Listing excerpt limit for Elementor editor<br />\nFixed: Filter category rest API issue<br />\nFixed: Ajax filter number issue<br />\nAdded: Tag support at REST API</p>\n<p>Version 3.0.0 (Dec 20, 2024)<br />\nUpdated: REST API<br />\nUpdated: Menu Arrangement<br />\nAdded: Fontawesome 6 compatibility<br />\nAdded: Chat count<br />\nFixed: Text domain issue<br />\nFixed: Elementor Widgets Sortable Field Placeholder Text<br />\nFixed: Settings script load</p>\n<p>Version 2.4.3 (Nov 11, 2024)<br />\nAdded: Chat Count<br />\nVersion 2.4.2 (Nov 05, 2024)<br />\nFixed: Filter searching issue form select, radio, checkbox<br />\nAdded: Ajax Filter custom field sorting option</p>\n<p>Version 2.4.1 (Oct 01, 2024)<br />\nFixed: Is online fixed ajax error<br />\nFixed: Select Field Label text Sortable Search Field<br />\nUpdated: Update rest API</p>\n<p>Version 2.4.0 (Sep 12, 2024)<br />\nAdded: Form builder Repeater field<br />\nUpdated: Coding update at Single listing and archive listing page for form builder capability</p>\n<p>Version 2.3.9 (Aug 16, 2024)<br />\nFixed: Stripe payment statement_descriptor_suffix issue<br />\nFixed: vendor php version required issue<br />\nAdded: Add new Control For Elementor Widget